# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# NOTE: `_redirects` matches request PATHS, not hostnames. Cloudflare Pages lists
# "domain-level redirects" as unsupported, so the lines below are kept as
# documentation of intent only and are IGNORED by Pages.
# The working *.pages.dev -> railkm.com 301 redirect is implemented in
# /functions/_middleware.js (a Pages Function), which runs before static assets.
https://railkm.pages.dev/* https://railkm.com/:splat 301
http://railkm.pages.dev/* https://railkm.com/:splat 301
